WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.533
Tom shook as he looked at the dragon.

2
00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:17.072
"You can do this," Tom told himself.

3
00:00:17.073 --> 00:00:20.575
"You can stop the dragon!"

4
00:00:20.576 --> 00:00:23.775
Tom waved his wand.

5
00:00:23.776 --> 00:00:28.855
"Dragon—begone!" he cried.

6
00:00:28.856 --> 00:00:33.033
But the dragon didn't go.

7
00:00:33.034 --> 00:00:39.028
The dragon danced.

8
00:00:39.029 --> 00:00:44.791
Tom waved his wand again and again.

9
00:00:44.792 --> 00:00:48.042
The dragon did jumping jacks.

10
00:00:48.043 --> 00:00:58.765
The dragon spun around.

11
00:00:58.766 --> 00:01:02.105
Suddenly Cat got an idea.

12
00:01:02.106 --> 00:01:05.163
She pointed to the farmer's milk cart.

13
00:01:05.164 --> 00:01:14.716
"Tom, can you make the cart roll?"

14
00:01:14.717 --> 00:01:16.886
Tom waved his wand.

15
00:01:16.887 --> 00:01:20.103
"Milk cart—start!"

16
00:01:20.104 --> 00:01:25.229
The cart sat there.

17
00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:27.101
Tom tried again.

18
00:01:27.102 --> 00:01:31.105
This time the cart did move.

19
00:01:31.106 --> 00:01:35.587
It rolled fast down the hill!

20
00:01:35.588 --> 00:01:41.890
Boom! The cart crashed into a tree and flipped over.

21
00:01:41.891 --> 00:01:45.053
Milk spilled everywhere.

22
00:01:45.054 --> 00:01:49.801
Roar! The dragon roared.

23
00:01:49.802 --> 00:01:52.316
Then it froze!

24
00:01:52.317 --> 00:01:56.855
Milk was flowing toward the dragon.

25
00:01:56.856 --> 00:02:09.781
It sniffed the milk . . . and licked it up!

26
00:02:09.782 --> 00:02:12.926
The dragon roared again.

27
00:02:12.927 --> 00:02:19.657
But this time no flames came out.

28
00:02:19.658 --> 00:02:23.200
"Look!" Tom cried.

29
00:02:23.201 --> 00:02:30.599
"The dragon is leaving!"

30
00:02:30.600 --> 00:02:33.836
Tom looked at Cat.

31
00:02:33.837 --> 00:02:36.006
She shrugged.

32
00:02:36.007 --> 00:02:40.071
"The dragon was holding its belly," she said.

33
00:02:40.072 --> 00:02:46.056
"Ann said milk is good for an upset stomach."

34
00:02:46.057 --> 00:02:56.606
Everyone ran up to the roof.

35
00:02:56.607 --> 00:03:00.307
Dirk glared as the king shook Tom's hand.

36
00:03:00.308 --> 00:03:04.320
"Well done, Tom!" the king cried.

37
00:03:04.321 --> 00:03:16.751
Ann held up her roses. "Yes, Tom."

